    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 191 solitaire variants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>Space</strong> key in emergency to instantly switch to standard boring cards on a green table.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win solitaire games and then play casual puzzles to unlock hundreds of pictures in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own card sets in an in-built cards editor. Even with animated GIFs or videos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: if you don't need the porn, please download <strong>Free Solitaire</strong> app of mine instead.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't want friends see you playing it? Open Steam Library, right click on NSFW Solitaire in the list, Properties. This opens up a dialog. On the left, click &quot;Privacy&quot; tab. Toggle &quot;Mark as Private&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To hide the game in Discord app: open Settings (cog button). On the left, in &quot;Activity settings&quot;, open &quot;Registered Games&quot; tag, and for NSFW Solitaire click on &quot;eye&quot; to turn off detection.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 191 solitaire variants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>Space</strong> key in emergency to instantly switch to standard boring cards on a green table.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win solitaire games and then play casual puzzles to unlock hundreds of pictures in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own card sets in an in-built cards editor. Even with animated GIFs or videos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: if you don't need the porn, please download <strong>Free Solitaire</strong> app of mine instead.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't want friends see you playing it? Open Steam Library, right click on NSFW Solitaire in the list, Properties. This opens up a dialog. On the left, click &quot;Privacy&quot; tab. Toggle &quot;Mark as Private&quot;.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To hide the game in Discord app: open Settings (cog button). On the left, in &quot;Activity settings&quot;, open &quot;Registered Games&quot; tag, and for NSFW Solitaire click on &quot;eye&quot; to turn off detection.</i></p>",
